# src/**/*.ts

- No framework: handlers in `src/api/*`, wired in `server.ts`.
- Figure responses: include `as_of`; null stays null.
- Reads from views/extract; writes only logistics/import/control-panel.
- Match file style; no new deps unless asked. Prefer Auto Cost / fast model for small edits; Intelligence for auth/SSE/ingest bugs.
